===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[flash]] [[drive]]}}

# {{context|computer hardware|lang=en}} A small [[electronic]] device used to store [[digital]] [[data]], more [[portable]] and [[robust]] than a [[hard drive]].

====Synonyms====
* [[USB]] flash drive
* [[USB key]]
* [[jump drive]]
* [[thumb drive]]
* [[pen drive]]

